# @neoxlabs/cli-__PLATFORM__

> Platform-specific binary for [@neoxlabs/cli](https://npmjs.com/@neoxlabs/cli) — **__PLATFORM__**.

**Do not install this package directly.** It's an optional dependency of
`@neoxlabs/cli`. `npm install -g @neoxlabs/cli` picks the right platform
package automatically.

## Contents

- `__EXE_NAME__` — Bun single-file executable. Contains the entire Neox CLI
  bundled with the Bun runtime. No JavaScript source is exposed.

Built with `bun build --compile --target=bun-__BUN_TARGET__`.

